nd profundity that concerns itself with issues as fundamental as the meaning of life and death. Even the heroic ethic itself\u2014with its emphasis on pride, honour, prowess in battle, and submission to the inexorable will of the gods\u2014is not left unquestioned.", "ocaid": "iliad0000home", "isbn_10": ["0192815946"], "lccn": ["86673106"], "oclc_numbers": ["14099110"], "lc_classifications": ["PA4025.A2 F5x 1984", "PA4025.A2"], "latest_revision": 28, "revision": 28, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2008-04-01T03:28:50.625462"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2026-01-21T18:28:52.897309"}},
